===persian===

ابرِ سیاهِ دغدغه را
از کوه شانه‌ها بران
برخیز ای شاخهٔ جوان
کِی وقت خفتن است...
این لحظه... لحظه...
را دریاب...
برگ... برگِ بهارِ لب‌هایت
بی‌رگبارِ بوسه‌ها،
در سفرِ پاییز است...
چون آفتاب برتاب...
و عاشقانه درآمیز...
با خاک... با باد...
با آتش با آب...
دریاب... دیر است...
لحظه را دریاب.
۱۳۷۲/۲/۱۲

===machine===

Drive the black cloud of worry
off the mountain of your shoulders.
Rise, young branch —
when was it ever the hour for sleeping...
This moment... this moment...
take hold of it...
Leaf... the spring leaf of your lips,
with no cloudburst of kisses,
is travelling into autumn...
Blaze out like the sun...
and mingle like a lover...
with earth... with wind...
with fire, with water...
Take hold... it is late...
Take hold of the moment.
1372/2/12

===lantern===

Drive the black cloud of worry
off the mountain of your shoulders.
Rise, young branch —
when was it ever the hour for sleeping?
This moment — this moment —
take hold of it.
Leaf, the spring leaf of your lips,
with no cloudburst of kisses on it,
is already travelling into autumn.
Blaze out like the sun
and mingle like a lover
with earth, with wind,
with fire, with water.
Take hold — it is late.
Take hold of the moment.

1372/2/12

